SOURCE.json pins that release archive. solve.sh builds it with configure and
make without changing upstream files, and retains the archive alongside the
installed program. Its temporary build directory is removed after installation.

launch.py, start.sh and confine.c are separate environment and isolation files.
They configure the repository instance and apply Linux Landlock restrictions;
confine.c is preserved with the compiled isolation library. This distribution
is not affiliated with or endorsed by the Tig project.
